Third-party notices for vibegraph
==================================

This file lists third-party material redistributed with vibegraph binaries,
as required by that material's own license. It is compiled into every
`vibegraph` binary and printed, together with vibegraph's own license texts,
by `vibegraph --version` — so the notices accompany each distributed binary
even when it is downloaded bare. `.github/workflows/release.yml` additionally
attaches this file to each release alongside the binaries. It does not
license vibegraph itself: that code is dual-licensed `MIT OR Apache-2.0`,
under `LICENSE-MIT` and `LICENSE-APACHE`.

MadGraph5_aMC@NLO Standard Model UFO model (models/sm)
--------------------------------------------------------

vibegraph interns two kinds of material derived from the `models/sm`
directory of MadGraph5_aMC@NLO (https://github.com/mg5amcnlo/mg5amcnlo),
committed at `vibegraph-lib/src/ufo/sm_assets/` and compiled directly into
every `vibegraph` binary via `include_str!`/`include_bytes!`
(`vibegraph-lib/src/ufo/sm.rs`):

  * The nine `restrict_*.dat` SM restriction cards
    (`restrict_default.dat`, `restrict_c_mass.dat`, `restrict_ckm.dat`,
    `restrict_lepton_masses.dat`, `restrict_no_b_mass.dat`,
    `restrict_no_masses.dat`, `restrict_no_tau_mass.dat`,
    `restrict_no_widths.dat`, `restrict_zeromass_ckm.dat`) are copied
    verbatim, byte for byte, from `models/sm/restrict_*.dat`.
  * `sm_parsed.bin.zst` is a compressed serialization of vibegraph's own
    parse of the rest of `models/sm` (`particles.py`, `parameters.py`,
    `vertices.py`, `lorentz.py`, `couplings.py`, `coupling_orders.py`,
    `function_library.py`, `decays.py`, `object_library.py`,
    `build_restrict.py`, `write_param_card.py`) — a derivative work of that
    UFO model definition, produced by the `gen_sm_blob` dev binary
    (`vibegraph-lib/src/ufo/sm.rs::regenerate`) and checked in.

`models/sm` carries no license of its own; it is covered by the license at
the root of the mg5amcnlo repository, reproduced below in full (this repo
vendors mg5amcnlo as the `research/refs/mg5amcnlo` git submodule; the assets
above were last regenerated from commit `b7687064b9a013317ca164aa1395bc9c0e39ae1e`
of that submodule — rerun `gen_sm_blob` and update that commit reference
here if the assets are regenerated from a newer checkout).

